+ ##

- petstore.pet(42L).get.call()
+ petstore.pet(42L).get.call()

- petstore.pet(42L).delete(api_key = t"…")
+ petstore.pet(42L).delete(api_key = t"…")

= petstore.pet(42L).delete(api_key = t"…")
